<description>&lt;p&gt;Mali forces have retaken Kidal as jihadist attacks intensify across the Sahel, while a Mali drone strike killed 13 civilians claimed to target militants. In Nigeria, bandits attacked in Niger State and were repelled, killing a soldier, and a convoy of Niger Governor Bago crashed, killing four students, a driver and a young woman. Algeria has deployed troops to Niger to protect energy assets, marking its first foreign mission in over 50 years, and Niger has accused Chad of a drone strike that killed two civilians. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNbjZadzVyQ2NQNlBMNVhaQU5Scy0zYVRUbDk2ZWRmUC1MdFgtMzd6aWdUN2pSZm5kbHpMYUgxOURrTHhwTW9xcWlQUld0aUl2c3dYNDFtOHNQTHd1dGx0cnlpN3NyNmQtTVdXNnZBTnhRTF84dEd0aEpwbkFnZ0hKN0tzQW0zTzBrWEVsem5SWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPWVZQcnVSbVZlRVVUOGd4OUdINXVJc0NPMlhwTnc3d2N1RHNNOElYb3ZjVXBWOUp0Z1I3a292M0pkVW00VWliTi1YelNmRlMtSU1vM29qVEFQek1acWxDMk1lMVRUUzBNUzhRN3BlUlY2SkRWZHA0RFBqTmtSdy1CZ05KT1Q0M1pZMW1QVTlVN0FEREhJa3g0TFphSFZuX1Jud0F1eWxkMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KMVU FOX 26 Medford&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPTGNfVzhZTy04YmZuc2IzM0hIdDVHWjhWUUZ5LUZ6SHMwdG81TlVoXzhlellXZFo3TUVtcncyanlhQzRPaGZ0ZHRwVHUzOVJUNEpfZUNzVk1ZRHduZHZDMXZpQWNEOHBFdDR6d3VxcG1ZQ1lvUEVhWEpPU2tCWGlJdUY2cVpPM2djSkRONHBjRUZpenpIMDRTWDVCSkZKUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Genocide Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPZjJLOHhkWGk